Assign Assessment & ATS Subscription API
Existing API Endpoint
POST https://api-admin.dev.pluginlive.com/assessment/assignSubscription

Old Payload Example (Assessment Subscription Only)

{
  "entityId": "fe539d1e-c866-4f35-be99-2de680d8dae6",  // institute_id
  "assessmentTypes": [
    "Cognitive", "Communication", "Tech_MCQ", "Tech_CODING", "Behavior"
  ],
  "entityType": "college",
  "practiceDegreeSets": [
    {
      "assessmentType": "Aptitude",
      "degreeList": [
        { "degreeId": "...", "streamId": "...", "specialisation": ["..."] },
        { "degreeId": "...", "isDegreeOnly": true },
        { "degreeType": "...", "isAllDegree": true }
      ]
    }
  ]
}

New Payload (Assessment + ATS Subscription)

{
  "entityId": "fe539d1e-c866-4f35-be99-2de680d8dae6",
  "entityType": "college",
  "accessLevel": 3,  // 0: No Access, 1: ATS, 2: Assessment, 3: Both
  "practiceDegreeSets": [
    {
      "assessmentType": "Aptitude",
      "degreeList": [
        { "degreeId": "...", "streamId": "...", "specialisation": ["..."] },
        { "degreeId": "...", "isDegreeOnly": true },
        { "degreeType": "...", "isAllDegree": true }
      ]
    }
  ]
}

Process Flow

Step 1 – Validate Required Payloads
    Check if entityId is present
        → If not, return: "entityId is required"

Validate accessLevel
    → If not in range 0–3, return: "Enter a valid accessLevel"
    
Step 2 – Validate Entity
    If entityType is college:
        → Fetch instituteData using entityId
        → Set entityName = campus_name

    If entityType is corporate:
        → Fetch corporateData using entityId
        → Set entityName = corporate_name

    If entityName is not found
        → Return: "Entity not found"

Step 3 – Assign Subscription
    If entityType is college
        → Call institute service API to create or update subscription
        → Payload: { instituteCampusId, accessLevel, practiceDegreeSets }
        → If API fails, return error

Step 4 – Return Response
    On success, return the success response with assigned subscription details.

